        <section class="section" id="difference">
          <p class="section-kicker">04 · Differentiation thesis</p>
          <h2>The strongest difference is an integrated French learning loop</h2>
          <p>Simple French with Hems can credibly differentiate on <strong>continuity</strong>: assess a learner, place them on a standards-referenced path, teach a target, rehearse it through different modalities, use it in a meaningful scenario, provide feedback, and return it later. Its public catalogue supplies components for each stage.<a class="cite" href="#ref-1">1</a>–<a class="cite" href="#ref-6">6</a> The value is not merely having more tools; the long-term value of this architecture would come from ensuring that tools increasingly share a common learner model, vocabulary map, level system and progress framework.</p>

          <figure class="figure" aria-labelledby="flywheel-title">
            <p class="figure-number">Figure 1 · Author synthesis</p>
